cli.approval.help:
deckent approval [list] [--scope <id>] [--json]
  Waiting approvals first (read); on your terminal pick one and answer it.
deckent approval decide [--scope <id>] [--reason <text>]
  On your terminal: pick, then a card (once / no); the reason is optional.
deckent approval list|inspect|decide|renew --input <file|-> [--json]
    [--verbose]
  The AI and JSON path, unchanged.
deckent approval <action> --schema
  Print the JSON input contract.
Fields: list {schemaVersion:1, scopeId, afterId|null, limit}
  inspect {schemaVersion:1, scopeId, approvalId}
  decide {schemaVersion:1, scopeId, approvalId, commandId, expectedRevision,
    decision: allow|deny, reason}
  renew {schemaVersion:1, scopeId, approvalId, commandId, expectedRevision,
    reason}
Example: {"schemaVersion":1,"scopeId":"live","afterId":null,"limit":20}

